This project is an independent study course built on:
《深入理解 AI Agent：设计原理与工程实践》 / Understanding AI Agents
Author: 李博杰 (Bojie Li)
Copyright 2025 Bojie Li
Upstream: https://github.com/bojieli/ai-agent-book
Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE)

The course follows the book's v2.0 edition. All links to the book and its
experiments are pinned to upstream commit
dbc046eb896ac4e39aa19c7774c8bf49583b89a6.
The book text itself is not redistributed here; earlier versions of this
repository bundled a v1.4 PDF (source.pdf), which has been removed.

Changes made in this project:
- Reorganized the book into modules and lessons with reading ranges,
  breakdowns, self-check questions and review cards, written in Chinese.
- Added step-by-step browser animations of the book's mechanisms.
  Animations are teaching illustrations; numbers taken from the book are
  cited, other values are illustrative, and none are reproduced results of
  the book's experiments.
- Added mini-agent, a small Python agent with exercises and tests that
  implement the book's principles.

